    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald McDermott are delighted to present Mons Lodge , a former officers residence dating back to c.1830. Steeped in character, this charming home has been extensively restored and thoughtfully brought into the modern era, while retaining many of its architectural features.\nSet within a quiet tree lined cul de sac, Mons Lodge enjoys a wonderful balance of privacy and convienience, while being within walking distance of all town amenities.\n\nViewing by appointment is highly reccommended to fully appreciate the character and quality of this exceptional home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.53x3.19\nTiled floor. Carpeted stairwell.Alarm point. Ceiling Light fitting.\n\nStudy - 2.01x 2.29\nTiled floor. Downlights. Fitted storage.Sash window to front. Blind\n\nLobby - 4.50x2.97\nTiled Floor. Downlights. Sash window to rear. Blind.\n\nSitting room - 2.85 x 5.67\nHerringbone wooden flooring. Ceiling light.Curtains, Blinds and pole.Solid fuel stove. Marble fireplace, surround & hearth.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.10 x 3.54\nCarpeted floor. Roman blind. Light fitting\n\nBathroom - 3.27x 1.65\nWalk in rainfall shower. Sink, vanity unit. Toilet. Electric mirror. Heated towel rail.Part tiled walls and tiled floor.\n\nOpen Plan Kitchen, Living , Diner - 8.96 x6.52\nHerringbone wooden floor.Solid inframe shaker fitted kitchen. Quartz worktop.Integrated appliances. Electric Aga oven. Velux windows. Built in media unit. Valted ceiling.Electric stove. Marble fireplace, surround and hearth.Sliding doors to patio. Blinds. Light fitting.\n\nUtility Room - 2.09 x 2.32\nFitted floor units.Plumbing.\n\nPlant room - 2.19 x 1.17\nAir to water unit.Water tanks. Heating manifolds. Attic Access\n\nLanding - 2.51 x1.41\nCarpeted flooring.Light Fitting.\n\nBedroom 2 - 5.52 x 4.27\nCarpeted flooring. Light fitting. Fireplace. Ensuite off.\n\nEnsuite - 3.95 x 1.82\nToilet. Sink. Mirror. Heated towel rail.Freestanding bath. Tiled Floor.Roman blind.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.56x3.06\nCarpeted floor. Fireplace.Built in Wardrobe.Roman Blind. Light fitting\n\n"
      },
